# Scope

`AGENTS.md` is the contract. The file tree is truth. Skeleton plus
email/password auth, workspace tables, two read endpoints (`GET
/api/workspaces`, `GET /api/projects/:projectId`), a read-only dashboard
(`useWorkspaces`), the `column` and `task` tables and the board API (`GET
/api/projects/:projectId/board`, `POST /api/projects/:projectId/tasks`,
`PATCH`/`DELETE /api/tasks/:taskId`).
**No OpenViking** — never call the `openviking` MCP, `ov_*`, or `viking://`;
ignore parent OV policy.

**Do not implement** until a later session asks: other write endpoints,
membership flows, moving tasks, column endpoints, Kanban board UI, drag-and-drop,
realtime, comments, `@mentions`, email, deploy, `sesion-*` git tags.

**Never add:** Next, Astro, Express, Fastify, Nest, `@hono/node-server`,
Supabase, Postgres, Prisma, Turso Cloud, Redux, Zustand, React Router, tRPC,
Socket.IO, React Hook Form, ESLint, Prettier, dotenv, Redis, Turborepo, Nx.

Keep layers separate. The browser never decides tenant authorization.

| Concern | Owner |
|---|---|
| Static types | TypeScript |
| Runtime IO | Zod in `@agentic-kanban/schemas` |
| Auth | Better Auth in `apps/api/src/auth/` |
| Authz | API membership checks (`requireSession` + `workspace_member`) |
| Tenant isolation | `workspace_id` on every tenant query |

Four packages only (`apps/web`, `apps/api`, `packages/db`, `packages/schemas`).
Internal deps: `workspace:*`. After edits: `vp check` must stay green.
